COMMENT     Route: cytosolic (+E5 degron, free C-terminus)
COMMENT     Asks: Cytosolic baseline, and the only construct where
            the degron has a free C-terminus -- so this is the
            degron-positive comparator.
COMMENT     Blunt-ligate into pJET1.2 in either orientation; recover the IVT
            template by PCR with IVT_F and IVT_R.
